  "result": "Perfect! All 56 tests pass. I've successfully implemented the invoice numbering system:\n\n**Created src/numbering.js:**\n- **nextInvoiceNumber(existingNumbers, issueDate)** \u2014 Returns the next free invoice number in format `INV-<year>-<counter>` where:\n  - Year is extracted from issueDate\n  - Counter is 4 digits, zero-padded, starting at 0001\n  - Restarts at 0001 for each new year\n  - Handles unordered numbers, gaps, and large counters\n\n**Added to src/invoices.js:**\n- **issueInvoice(invoice, existingNumbers)** \u2014 Returns `ok(newInvoice)` with:\n  - Invoice number assigned using nextInvoiceNumber\n  - Status changed to 'issued'\n  - All other fields preserved\n  - Returns `NOT_DRAFT` if invoice status isn't 'draft'\n  - Does not mutate the original invoice\n\n**Added 16 new tests:**\n- 10 tests for nextInvoiceNumber covering all edge cases (first numbers, incrementing, year isolation, gaps, large counters, padding)\n- 6 tests for issueInvoice covering number assignment, field preservation, status check, and immutability",
